  "releaseNotes": "- Updated LogicMonitor.Api to 3.240.79.\n\t\t- Ignored two new Resource members, DedicatedLogCollectorGroupId and\n\t\t  IsPreferredLogCollectorGroupConfigured, on the ResourceStoreItem to Resource map.\n\t\t  LogicMonitor.Api added them to model fields the portal returns; the Datamart stores a\n\t\t  curated subset and reconstructs partial Api objects, so new live-portal-only members\n\t\t  are ignored in the reverse direction, as the existing collector members already are.\n\t\t  Without this, AssertConfigurationIsValid throws at DatamartClient construction with\n\t\t  \"Unmapped members found for ResourceStoreItem -> Resource\", which surfaces downstream\n\t\t  as a macro execution failure.",
